    "proximate_text": "This event was caused by an error that was introduced during a modification to the HVK-CHL1(A)(B)(C)(D) control logic. ... A bypass timer in the analog logic was not replicated in the new digital logic. ... the low chiller condenser flow signal was capable of causing the chiller start sequence to reset resulting in an extended chiller start sequence.",
    "cause_code": "X",
    "category": "Other",
    "theme": "digital control logic modification omitted bypass timer function",
    "provisional": false
  },
